{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24051","headline":"寄卢少尹 · 白居易","name":"寄卢少尹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"老诲心不乱，庄戒形太劳。\n生命既能保，死籍亦可逃。\n嘉肴与旨酒，信是腐肠膏。\n艳声与丽色，真爲伐性刀。\n补养在积功，如裘集衆毛。\n将欲致千里，可得差一毫。\n颜回何爲者，簟瓢才自给。\n肥醲不到口，年不登三十。\n张苍何爲者，染爱浩无际。\n妾媵填後房，竟寿百余岁。\n苍寿有何德，回夭有何辜。\n谁谓具圣体，不如肥瓠躯。\n遂使世俗心，多疑仙道书。\n寄问卢先生，此理当何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24051.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24051","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}